This folder is intentionally created empty in Phase 1 (Foundation).
It will be populated in later phases:

controllers/    -> Phase 2+ (auth, products, auctions, orders...)
models/         -> Phase 2+ (data access layer per table)
services/       -> Phase 2+ (business logic: bidding, auction closing, checkout)
state-machine/  -> Phase 3 (product state machine transitions)
tests/          -> Phase 2+ (backend tests per section 37 of the spec)
